{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgmffM6UQXLL7q8HW9D65","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I think the employer adds a lot. As far as I could make out, it's 750 ₪ a month from me and 2,250 ₪ a month from them. But the picture showed a red minus of 64,761 ₪ if I take the money out after 5 years, and that frightened me. I won't sign anything until you or someone at the bank explains it. I'm not sure about this.\n\n**What decided it.** Under the bar picture there was one sentence I could read: \"750 ₪ בחודש מכם, 2,250 ₪ מהמעסיק\". That part sounded good, three times what I put in. Then came the tall bars. First \"45,000 ₪\", then a yellow \"+135,000 ₪\", then \"−64,761 ₪\" in a pink-red striped box, and at the end \"136,457 ₪\". I don't add numbers, but a minus that big made me back away. Above the small bars it said in pink \"לפני 6 שנים: מס\". So I think taking the money out early costs a lot of tax, and after 6 years it's \"פטור עד התקרה\". What ceiling? I don't know.\n\n**What I looked at, in order:**\n1. **The top: \"קרן השתלמות\".** It said it's savings that you and the employer pay into, and after 6 years you take it out without tax. That sounded familiar, so I stayed. There was a list of what you pay if you take it out before 6 years. \"31%\" stayed with me.\n2. **\"למה משתמשים בזה\".** It said that for employees this is usually the first step. Then came little buttons: \"מסלול כללי\", \"אג\"ח ממשלתית\", \"מדד S&P 500\". Government bonds I know. S-and-P I read out letter by letter.\n3. **The calculator with the bars.** I never saw where my 30,000 was typed in. That part of the page went by between screens. I saw boxes with \"7 %\" and \"0.54 %\" and a button \"חזרה לערך ההתחלתי\". The many small bars of years 1 to 12, with stripes, I didn't try to read.\n4. **Next screen.** Lots of small grey lines: \"S&P500\", \"47% מס\", \"15,712 ₪\", \"0.7%\", \"0.19%\". I skimmed them. One sentence I did catch: the closest thing with the same risk is \"חשבון ניירות ערך\", without the tax benefit.\n5. **\"מי מציע\".** The companies were Harel, Altshuler Shaham and Meitav. I know Harel.\n6. **\"כמה זה עולה\".** Management fees \"עד 2% בשנה\", and exit fees \"אין\". That calmed me a little. I stopped at \"מיסוי\". That was six screens and I was tired. I didn't read any further.\n\n**What I didn't understand:** S&P 500, \"מדד\" here (not the price index from the news), \"מסלול\", \"דמי ניהול 0.54%\" against \"עד 2%\", \"47% מס\", \"התקרה\", \"15,712 ₪\", \"ריאלי\", the stripes in the bars, and the codes \"TXH-09\", \"KH-15\", \"PF-18\". There were also little \"חוקים וכללים · 15\" tags. I don't know what they are.\n\n**What bothered me:**\n- The whole page is black with grey writing. The lines under the chart were small and pale, and I couldn't really read them even with my glasses.\n- The striped pink and red colours look almost the same.\n- Nowhere did it say in one plain sentence whether it's safe like a deposit.\n- It never said what would happen if I don't join."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":3872,"cache_read_input_tokens":11493,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":3872},"output_tokens":6,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"628ff816-bf7c-4d9f-89f6-600369fa5442","uuid":"70c77bfe-bd46-4730-ba37-207892852ef5","timestamp":"2026-11-06T12:23:18.417Z","request_id":"req_011CgmffLnP2a7n744CJbxTH"}
